CrediClip: Evidence-Aware Credibility Scoring for Short-Form Video
How I framed, designed, built, and evaluated an AI system that turns a public TikTok, Instagram, or YouTube Shorts
link into an explainable credibility score, and why the most important feature turned out to be knowing when
not to be confident.
By Ali Raza
